S3-A episodes 4-6 — console output
==================================
Arm unchanged. Tool description, prompts, world, model, temperature, agreement
object, update mechanism, probe setup and tool-availability rules all untouched.
No reminder or instruction to use get_agreement was added.

RUN LOCATION NOTE. The desktop shell reachable from this session has no network
(api.anthropic.com: "Temporary failure in name resolution") and no `anthropic`
package, so episodes 4-6 could not be executed there. They were run in the
session's cloud container from a staged copy of this directory, with
anthropic==0.125.0 (the pinned SDK) installed. Before running, the copy passed
all 80 offline gates, and each invocation's own runtime baseline comparison
against pilot2_s3 reported `all identical to S3-N : True`. Records were written
back here. The API key was scrubbed from the container after the run.

Because the Bash call limit is 600s and episodes take ~150-330s, the three
episodes were invoked one at a time (--episodes 4, then 5, then 6) rather than
as --episodes 4-6. run_c3.py rewrites _run_manifest.json on every invocation, so
each invocation's manifest was preserved as _run_manifest_ep04/05/06.json and
this directory's _run_manifest.json remains the episodes 1-3 one
(_run_manifest_ep1_3.json is an identical backup).

